  - Activates a steering direction BETWEEN English and Hindi
  - This direction doesn't strongly align with safety concepts in EITHER language
  - Result: safety steering is weakened → model 'forgets' constraints
  - Analogous to bilingual cognitive load in psycholinguistics
  - Supports: Li et al. (2022) 'Language Confusion in Multilingual LLMs'
